Origin and modifications
========================

Shell is a modified version of Sunshine and Apollo:

  Sunshine - Copyright (C) LizardByte and contributors
    https://github.com/LizardByte/Sunshine
    GNU General Public License v3.0

  Apollo - Copyright (C) ClassicOldSong (Yukino Song) and contributors
    https://github.com/ClassicOldSong/Apollo
    GNU General Public License v3.0
    Apollo is itself a modified version of Sunshine.

Juno Park modified this work in 2026 (GNU GPL v3, section 5a). The modifications include, among others:
the renaming of the program, its service, files and settings to Shell; resizing and automatic release
of the virtual display; live bitrate changes; remote shutdown and restart; image and file clipboard
transfer; Ctrl+Alt+Del through the service; adaptive video packet pacing; session history and the
status dashboard of the web UI; a redesigned web UI theme and icons; English and Korean host messages;
and the PowerShell installer, recovery, connection and statistics tools. Each source file may contain
code from Sunshine, Apollo and Shell.


